As in the preceding example, we reduce the calculation of dn (.20|.81) to that of dn (.19 \(\left|\frac{360}{361}\right|\)) when

\[=.982218+\frac{1}{4}\chi\frac{1}{361}\left(.187746\right)\left(.982218\right) \text{dn}\left(.19\left|\frac{369}{361}\right|\right)=.982267\]

